    "name": "every delete path (one, two, a burst) goes through one breaker: the burst is held, every deleted file stays recoverable",
    "description": "ICEDRIVE-001 (Icedrive): 'Do Not Delete' was honoured for one deletion but two or more switched to a batch delete that removed the cloud copies. Rules D1/D2 (sync-chaos delete-backup-mode, delete-one-subfolder): one policy for every path; a burst over half a folder is held; deletes keep versions.",
    "steps": [
